id: sash
name: Sash
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
craftDC: Qualified
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Impulsive Saving Throw 1(bT) higher while worn.
text: >
  Sash: A flowing piece of fabric, typically worn hanging free from the waist or around one
  shoulder.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: Increase your Impulsive Saving Throws by 1(bT).

---

# While worn: "Accessories are Basic Items that can be equipped and apply benefits while
# equipped." Taken off, it does nothing.
[passive]
save.impulsive += 1(bT);
